GIR PHONE RUNBOOK
• GIR never places orders
• a problem here hits GIR messages only

WHERE TO LOOK FIRST
• the page: girtrader.com
• health check, no login:
• girtrader.com/preview/api/gir/status.json
• OK = all well, PROBLEM = it says what
• phone alarm app ntfy = P1 alarms only

NO MESSAGES FROM GIR
• a HEARTBEAT line every 30 min, 09:30-15:30
• none for 35 min = something is wrong
• type in System: /gir status
• no answer in 2 min: open the health check
• want alerts now: /gir mode old

THE PAGE IS DOWN
• Telegram still works without it
• the phone alarm says page server down
• it restarts by itself
• still down after 10 min: call

KITE KEY DEGRADED
• one Kite key failed the 08:20 check
• its prices are STALE: no GO NOW on them
• GIR retries at 08:25, 08:35, 08:45
• RISK GATES BLIND = your account not read
• then NO BUY at all - Kite is the truth

AI - THREE DIFFERENT MESSAGES
• AI CREDIT EMPTY = the money ran out
• fix: top up at console.anthropic.com
• AI KEY REFUSED = the key, not the money
• fix: check the key at console.anthropic.com
• AI PROVIDER DOWN = Anthropic not answering
• fix: nothing, wait - GIR retries itself
• in all three: GIR runs on rules
• shock alerts stay on

TELEGRAM DEAD
• GIR retries every message once
• 3 failures in 10 min = a phone alarm
• the page and health check still work

WHAT TO TYPE (SYSTEM TOPIC)
• /gir status = mode + reasons to flip
• /gir mode old = OLD news senders back
• /gir mode new = the new desk (default)
• on the server: gir mode old / new / status
• the website Settings page has the switch

MONDAY NOTE
• old engine and falcon are PAUSED by you
• so gir mode old brings back ONLY old news
• it does NOT bring back old trade alerts
• flip on a FLIP REASON n is TRUE line
• flip back to NEW when the cause is fixed

CARRY - ONLY IF YOU CHOOSE
• NO CARRY by default
• declare it with the helper on the server
• max 1 carry, 0.5% risk
• 09:08 next day: EXIT / HOLD / STOP
• Mon 23 to Wed 25 = two nights (Tue holiday)

